    </TIER>
    <TIER LINGUISTIC_TYPE_REF="default-lt" TIER_ID="SPEAKER_00">
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a258"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts2" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts5">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What have you been hesitant to speak to me about and why?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a443"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts6" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts11">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>God, this sounds like blind date.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a454"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts13" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts17">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And you don't have to answer that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a445"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts29" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts30">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Hi. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a446"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts40" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts46">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>If for some reason I lost all my memory, what's the first thing you'd tell me about us?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a448"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts88" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts90">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I so remember that Rebecca. I was a young consultant at the time.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a449"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts91" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts95">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And you know, you were one of our first complex patients on the ward.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a452"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts96" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts97">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a453"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts111" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts116">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Absolutely. And I remember this is a challenge. Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a455"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts117" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts122">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Sanjay, you know, you've got to prove yourself as a consultant.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a456"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts123" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts132">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And we took you. And then in the end, I think you got better and we got slightly bored of you.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a457"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts146" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts152">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>First time I met you was up on the ward, as you say, and you were not very well.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a458"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts153" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts156">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I was a new consultant. You know, for me at the time, this was a clinical conundrum rather than,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a459"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts157" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts158">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>hey, listen, this is a person that's been really unwell for a long time.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a460"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts159" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts163">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I'm just taking me back to an old story.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a461"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts164" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts170">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I remember a time when I was a very junior doctor at a hospital in the Midlands.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a462"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts171" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts172">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I won't name the hospital or the consultant, but I remember going on the ward run.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a463"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts173" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts179">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And this was like an old, you know, almost a carry on movie, a ward run where, you know,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a464"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts180" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts185">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>a matron in charge and the consultant wearing his suit and bow tie would turn up with an entourage of</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a465"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts186" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts193">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>junior doctors and medical students. And there was somebody who had been diagnosed with pancreatic cancer.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a466"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts194" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts202">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And all he did was went into the behind the curtains, pulled out the Lord's Prayer from his inner jacket.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a469"
