            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a328"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts336" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts341">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So it's just primarily me and my, I don't know, call it a phobia of taking pills.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a329"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts342" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts346">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I think that was one of the scariest things for me through my journey of HIV was having watched my partner,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a330"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts347" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts348">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>whose life was literally around taking medication.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a331"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts349" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts351">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Some in the morning, some with food, some without food.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a332"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts352" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts358">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And because he had other health conditions that he was dealing with, he took so many tablets.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a333"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts359" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts360">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I often ask myself, the day I get to start taking my medication, I pray it won't be like this.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a334"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts361" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts362">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And fortunately, when I started, the regimens were much better.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a335"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts363" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts364">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Side effects were much better.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a336"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts365" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts366">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So I came and started at a time when I didn't really need to think too much about it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a337"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts367" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts368">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So that was easy for me.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a338"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts369" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts372">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I think the switch that you need to take this, it is part of your life now.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a339"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts373" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts376">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Even that, I took the medication.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a340"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts377" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts378">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>First of all, it took me a year to negotiate, you know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a341"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts379" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts380">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So we start thinking about you taking it, okay.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a342"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts381" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts384">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>A whole year went by and then we thought, right, I'm ready.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a343"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts385" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts386">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Psychologically, I'm ready.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a344"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts387" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts389">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I will take them.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a345"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts390" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts399">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But even when I did bring them home, I think they sat on the table for two weeks.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a346"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts400" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts402">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And then I started.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a347"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts403" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts404">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And then once I'd started, that was it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a348"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts405" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts410">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I didn't need to think about, oh, I had, psychologically, I was ready, and I took them without a problem.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a349"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts411" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts421">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What do you feel has been the hardest part about HIV treatment for me and why?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a351"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts425" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts428">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a356"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts441" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts445">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a358"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts450" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts452">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It's still a question.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a365"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts481" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts485">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But that's part of the trust issue, is that it's a two-way conversation.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a366"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts486" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts488">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Do you make a suggestion?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a367"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts489" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts494">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You know, and then you think, yeah, actually, I've never thought about that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a368"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts495" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts496">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Let me go away and think about it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a369"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts497" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts498">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And then you have the conversation.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a370"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts499" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts500">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You try.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a371"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts502" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts510">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>One of the things I found that was really difficult in the beginning when I first started, which was I started with taking a combination twice a day.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a372"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts511" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts514">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Now, with young children, that was just almost impossible.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a373"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts515" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts521">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So it's nice to hear that you think I'm adherent pretty much the time.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a374"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts522" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts527">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Absolutely.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a375"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts528" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts529">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But in the beginning, it was really difficult because my morning regime, I'd be in the middle of trying to get ready for work, trying to send the kids off to school.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a376"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts530" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts531">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And sometimes I'd take it before I leave.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a377"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts532" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts534">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Sometimes I used to work for a legal practice at the time.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a378"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts535" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts536">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Sometimes you'd get into the office, dump your bag, and it'd all go until whatever, and you'd think, oh, I haven't taken my medication.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a379"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts537" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts540">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Midday.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a380"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts541" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts543">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So it was really up and down.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a381"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts544" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts546">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And again, that was part of the thing.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a382"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts547" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts548">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I came back and I said, this isn't working for me.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a383"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts549" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts550">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Again, the listening was a really key part.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a384"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts551" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts554">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And they said, oh, OK.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a385"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts555" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts556">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So because of lifestyle, we're going to have to think about it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a386"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts557" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts558">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And it was changed to the very old one that I was on for years and years and years.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a387"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts559" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts560">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But then said, well, now, you know, things have moved on.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a388"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts561" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts563">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We can give you one.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a389"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts564" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts566">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a390"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts567" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts569">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And the rest is history.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a391"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts570" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts576">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, yeah, I'm quite pleased.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a395"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts588" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts593">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a503"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts598" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts602">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a399"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts611" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts614">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a400"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts615" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts616">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You've just said something that's made me think, actually.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a401"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts617" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts622">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Very often you come in and you think, oh, I'm not going to say I've got a new job that requires me to be there for however long and all my job is a desk job.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a402"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts623" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts626">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We don't think those things are important.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a403"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts627" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts630">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But then in a sense it is because that helps you determine, OK, she's got two young kids.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a404"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts631" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts632">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You won't be able to do that in the morning.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a405"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts633" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts635">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Can we talk about.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a406"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts636" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts642">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It allows you to ask, are you able to take it in the morning because you seem quite busy.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a407"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts643" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts646">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I think that's something we need to think of as patients, because a lot of the time we think I'm just here for the clinical stuff.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a408"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts647" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts652">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But sometimes if you explain I'm living in a multi-occupation place and I would prefer something that's a bit more discreet, it helps you think and we can plan them together.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a409"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts653" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts657">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So I think that would be the takeaway message about the kinds of conversations that you have.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a410"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts658" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts668">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It's really important to be as open and honest as candid with the person who's trying his best to make your life and your care so that you can get the best quality of care, as they say.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a411"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts669" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts672">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But if you don't say anything, they'll never know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a412"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts673" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts678">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So it's very much a two way conversation. I think we've got to learn a lot of that. We've got to just be open and honest.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a413"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts682" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts686">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Right. If I met you years ago before you started working HIV and compared you to who you are now, what is the biggest difference I would notice?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a415"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts699" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts701">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So pre HIV consultant and post.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a417"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts708" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts717">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Which young man isn't though?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a419"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts722" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts726">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a512"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts734" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts735">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a513"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts745" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts747">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a423"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts748" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts750">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>HIV does that though?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a425"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts754" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts759">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It just changes the way you think and everything else.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a516"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts764" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts766">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>YEah</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a427"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts767" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts770">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So again, that's that silver lining, isn't it?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a429"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts778" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts783">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>In the middle of all of this tragedy is, yeah, it transforms people and how they think.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a430"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts784" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts785">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We have these preconceived ideas and notions about gay people, about the Black African society.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a431"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts786" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts787">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>When you get into the HIV sector, you think, now hang on a second. They're very similar in that respect. We're just people.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a432"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts788" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts794">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Being in this sector has just, it's made me more understanding, more, you know, of all of these things that we think we know about.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a433"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts795" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts796">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But until you actually come to your doorstep, you think, I have no clue.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a434"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts797" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts800">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So I've allowed myself to be slightly more open minded.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a435"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts801" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts803">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Same here.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a438"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts834" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts841">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oh, God. I would like you, if this were our last conversation, I would like you to go away and think that your input in my life has been enormous.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a439"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts842" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts849">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And without it, without you, I'd have probably been on another journey, if that makes sense.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a440"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts850" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts858">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Because I think my whole HIV journey has been influenced by all of the people in it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a441"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts859" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts862">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>The conversations that they've allowed us to have, the interactions. So that relationship is one that, if I had to write a biography, you'd certainly be in it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a442"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts863" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts866">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So yeah, you'd go away thinking you've made a change in my life.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
    </TIER>
